# No --volumes. It removes every volume not attached to a *running* container,
# and with the stacks down that is every development database on the machine —
# 10 of them here, across chalet, chalet-app, submissio, gym and payday. Drop a
# specific one by name when you mean to: docker volume rm <project>_postgres_data
